  "about_item": [
    "KILLS & REPELS FLEAS, TICKS & MOSQUITOES: This natural flea and tick spray is formulated to kill on contact and repel fleas, ticks, and mosquitoes using the power of essential oils. Disrupts the flea life cycle by targeting eggs, larvae, and adults so you can break infestations at the source. Powered by nature and built to perform.",
    "TREAT PESTS NATURALLY, NOT HARSHLY: A plant-based flea treatment that harnesses cedarwood oil, Rosemary oil, and sesame oil as a safe and effective alternative to chemical flea collars, drops, pills, and chewables. No pyrethrins, no permethrin, just nature working the way it should.",
    "SAFE FOR DOGS, CATS & THE WHOLE FAMILY: Gentle enough for puppies, kittens, and senior pets when used as directed. Powerful enough to fully eliminate pests on skin and fur. Safe to use around kids and the entire household. Read entire label prior to use. Test a small area on back of neck 1 hour before full body application. Do not soak pet.",
    "3-IN-1 SPRAY FOR PETS AND HOME: One bottle does it all. Use directly on your dog or cat, and also spray on carpet, furniture, pet bedding, crates, kennels, and cat condos. The refreshing Rosemary scent freshens your home while keeping pests away. Available in 16 oz, 32 oz, and 1 gallon sizes for every household need.",
    "OUR PROMISE: We aim to provide the highest quality and most beneficial products. If it doesn't work out for you, please let us know so we can make it right. If the sprayer is broken, please let us know for a replacement."
  ],
