      {
        "position": 4,
        "title": "Works great, smells more like eucalyptus",
        "text": "I love this spray! It’s natural, comes in a nice thick plastic and has such cute label. I have a lot of animals so I wanted something natural to help with the fleas and mosquitoes without hurting my pets and this really works so far. I use it primarily for mosquitos because the only place I’ve ever seen fleas is on my cats, so I have no idea where I would spray it to prevent new fleas. I’ve noticed less mosquitos are hanging out where I sprayed.The scent is strong! I could smell it through the packaging before I opened it but I think in this case, strong is good.I think this smells more like eucalyptus than rosemary but you might not. I prefer eucalyptus anyway so that’s a win for me.",
