      {
        "position": 5,
        "title": "Easy to Use Natural Flea and Tick Spray",
        "text": "I like having a natural option for helping protect my dogs from fleas and ticks, and this spray has been easy to use. It has a fresh herbal scent from the essential oils that isn't overpowering.The spray applies evenly to my dogs' coats, and I also use it on their bedding and other areas where they spend time. It's convenient to have one product that can be used on both pets and around the house.I appreciate that it's made with plant-based ingredients instead of harsh chemicals. As with any new product, I followed the directions and tested a small area first.If you're looking for a natural flea and tick spray for both pets and your home, this is a good option to consider.",
